          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Right margin, perpendicular lines.",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>during t[h]is holiday. Also (the writer is now addressing his mother-in-law), have regard for Abu\u02beI-Khayr and let her (her daughter) be fulfilled through you (your presence). May you not need to be commanded. Unlimited greetings</li>\n<li>especially to you and greetings to Umm Ibrahim and to Abu\u02bel-Faraj and to&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
